tible matrix theorem implies that $\\text{rank}(T)=4.$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since $T$ is invertible, the invertible matrix theorem implies that $\\text{nullity}(T)=0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I only.\""}]}
